-- Stays translations: every published resort, hotel and guesthouse
-- (150 properties) into all 6 rolled-out languages (de/es/it/ru/ja/zh),
-- powering /{locale}/maldives/{resorts,hotels,guesthouses}/[slug]/.
-- Each property's own description is hand-translated (141); the
-- 9 with only the short "X is a resort on <island>, <atoll>..." summary are
-- generated from those same facts. Property names and slugs stay as-is
-- (real names); short_description and description both carry the
-- translated summary, as for activities. Kandima's English summary opens
-- with a paragraph copied from Four Seasons Landaa Giraavaru -- only the
-- Kandima-specific part is translated. Already applied directly against
-- the live DB; this file keeps a from-scratch replay in sync.
on conflict (entity_id, locale) do update set
  slug = excluded.slug, title = excluded.title, short_description = excluded.short_description, description = excluded.description,
  body_html = excluded.body_html, meta_title = excluded.meta_title, meta_description = excluded.meta_description,
  translation_status = excluded.translation_status, translated_by = excluded.translated_by, updated_at = now();
